  "title": "Answer: a state is conscious when one is aware of being in it",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "3e6dc143-7b82-4d54-a014-51239bea04dd",
      "text": "Consciousness, in the sense of a state being conscious, is one's being aware of being in that state in a suitably immediate way, through a higher-order representation of it.",
